    "body": "# User Story\r\n\r\n### As a: teacher and admin\r\n\r\n\r\n### I want: to ensure the EU-DSGVO\r\n\r\n\r\n### so that:\r\n\r\n\r\n## Acceptance criteria:\r\n- [x] accept storage of personal data\r\n- [x] decline storage of personal data\r\n- [x] #776 inform user of stored data\r\n- [x] #775 delete personal data\r\n- [x] #565 cookie information\r\n- [x] #768 impressum\r\n- [x] #550 terms of use\r\n- [x] #778 add checkbox for accepting privacy declaration\r\n- [x] Registration checkbox accept terms of use\r\n(- [ ] GoogleOptOut or GoogleOptOut hint in disclaimer)\r\n\r\n## Additional info:\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nATTENTION:\r\nPlease tag this issue if you are sure to which tag(s) it belongs.\r\n-->\r\n",
